{"id": "EUVD-2026-97263", "enisaUuid": "9aec814c-ae96-3a12-abd2-458f4f6578df", "description": "An authenticated administrator can be induced to delete administrative Import/Export templates through a Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF) attack. The OTRS AdminImportExport::TemplateDelete action does not validate the request's ChallengeToken, allowing an unauthenticated remote attacker to craft a malicious request that is executed with the privileges of an active administrator session.\n\nThis issue affects OTRS:\n\n  *  7.0.X\n  *  8.0.X\n  *  2023.X\n  *  2024.X\n  *  2025.X\n  *  2026.X before 2026.7.X\n\nPlease note that ((OTRS)) Community Edition 6.x and before are vulnerable. Products based on the ((OTRS)) Community Edition also very likely to be affected", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T06:48:42", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T18:08:04", "baseScore": 5.4, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:N/I:L/A:L", "references": ["https://otrs.com/release-notes/otrs-security-advisory-2026-10/"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-48211", "GHSA-f36p-fv5h-jf99"], "assigner": "OTRS", "epss": 0.12, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2c9c974a-f77a-3fa2-b6a9-c9199554a6a7", "product": {"name": "OTRS", "vendor": {"name": "OTRS AG"}}, "product_version": "7.0.x"}, {"id": "47ec5b6e-e4ed-35fa-9eef-a0c8bcf2703d", "product": {"name": "OTRS", "vendor": {"name": "OTRS AG"}}, "product_version": "2024.x"}, {"id": "8d683b0d-c713-3cf2-a6af-381fd03643a2", "product": {"name": "OTRS", "vendor": {"name": "OTRS AG"}}, "product_version": "2023.x"}, {"id": "8eae4263-7c49-331a-9fa8-d1f57a904483", "product": {"name": "OTRS", "vendor": {"name": "OTRS AG"}}, "product_version": "8.0.x"}, {"id": "c5169f7c-b40f-3fcf-a006-e3ee09d12342", "product": {"name": "((OTRS)) Community Edition", "vendor": {"name": "OTRS AG"}}, "product_version": "6.x"}, {"id": "cded9ca1-fa45-38de-8e04-56f0a594c031", "product": {"name": "OTRS", "vendor": {"name": "OTRS AG"}}, "product_version": "2026.x \u22642026.6.x"}, {"id": "d5ee9a37-8f92-3d47-a476-88e2a5fa0231", "product": {"name": "OTRS", "vendor": {"name": "OTRS AG"}}, "product_version": "2025.x"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "d62a78f6-148a-3bf8-b281-f7eb0cac5a9e", "vendor": {"name": "OTRS GmbH (former OTRS AG)"}}], "isExploited": false}